    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d897">

                <pb facs="0819" n="703" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg703"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 850a.001/6.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the American
                        Minister</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 23.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-05-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 8, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to your dispatch No. 6 Luxemburg
                    series of the 4th ultimo, transmitting a letter from Her Royal Highness Marie
                    Anne, Regent of the Grand Duchy of Luxemburg, in which she notifies the
                    President of the death of His Royal Highness the Grand Duke William and that the
                    Regency will be continued until the attainment of majority of Her Royal Highness
                    Marie Adelaide, I inclose, with office copy, a letter addressed by the President
                    to Her Royal Highness Marie Anne, acknowledging her letter.<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d897-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>You will forward the copy to the Foreign Office of Luxemburg and deliver the
                    original in the manner most agreeable to Her Royal Highness.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Huntington Wilson.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
